{"4632470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crownseeker", "steam_appid": 4632470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake in a procedurally generated world with fog pressing in on all sides and hunger already gnawing at you. Somewhere out there — scattered across dangerous terrain, hidden in the dark — are relics. Find them all, and the Crown appears. Claim it, if you can survive what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt by Day. Hunt by Night.</strong> Day relics shimmer gold in the daylight. Night relics glow purple in the dark. Your compass guides you, but the world doesn't wait — and neither do the things that share it with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Everything</strong> Hunger is your most dangerous enemy. Every step costs you. Rest at campfires to bridge the day/night cycle, scavenge for food, and choose your fights carefully — wolves, bandits, wraiths, bog hags, and worse are all hunting their own meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Run</strong> Relics and equipment drop with unique bonuses. Each run, you shape a different build — then carry the best lessons forward through meta-progression modifiers unlocked across runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete for the Crown</strong> Finish a run and you're scored and graded — Legendary Relic Hunter down to mere Wanderer. Seed-based leaderboards let you compete on the same map as every other player. Daily seeds, random seeds, or custom seeds — your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One More Run</strong> Achievements. Unlockable run modifiers. Dynamic creature types. Procedurally generated maps with weather, campfires, fog of war, and a siege that waits for you at the end of every successful hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crown is yours to claim. Probably.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake in a procedurally generated world with fog pressing in on all sides and hunger already gnawing at you. Somewhere out there — scattered across dangerous terrain, hidden in the dark — are relics. Find them all, and the Crown appears. Claim it, if you can survive what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt by Day. Hunt by Night.</strong> Day relics shimmer gold in the daylight. Night relics glow purple in the dark. Your compass guides you, but the world doesn't wait — and neither do the things that share it with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Everything</strong> Hunger is your most dangerous enemy. Every step costs you. Rest at campfires to bridge the day/night cycle, scavenge for food, and choose your fights carefully — wolves, bandits, wraiths, bog hags, and worse are all hunting their own meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Run</strong> Relics and equipment drop with unique bonuses. Each run, you shape a different build — then carry the best lessons forward through meta-progression modifiers unlocked across runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete for the Crown</strong> Finish a run and you're scored and graded — Legendary Relic Hunter down to mere Wanderer. Seed-based leaderboards let you compete on the same map as every other player. Daily seeds, random seeds, or custom seeds — your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One More Run</strong> Achievements. Unlockable run modifiers. Dynamic creature types. Procedurally generated maps with weather, campfires, fog of war, and a siege that waits for you at the end of every successful hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crown is yours to claim. Probably.</p>", "short_description": "Hunt relics by day and night across a fog-shrouded world. Manage hunger. Gear up. Outlast or defeat what's hunting you. Collect all the relics — and the Crown appears. If you survive long enough to claim it.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632470/5499350a713cade7f53ceddc52fa65661d0c3f39/header.jpg?t=1781042477", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632470/07666ffca6d2270869bac6f00895d123db5a7324/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781042477", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632470/07666ffca6d2270869bac6f00895d123db5a7324/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781042477", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> \tIntel Core i3-6100 or AMD equivalent (dual-core, 2.5 GHz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> \tIntelHD Graphics 520 or equivalent — must support WebGL 2.0<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a GPU with WebGL 2.0 support. Integrated graphics supported.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Jeremy Petersen"], "publishers": ["Jeremy Petersen"], "demos": [{"appid": 4665420, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 599, "final": 599, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$5.99"}, "packages": [1613409], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Crownseeker", "description": "", "selec